---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Img from '../components/Img.astro';
---
<Base title="Terms of Use | Medina Hydro Jetting Pros" description="Terms for using the Medina Hydro Jetting Pros website." path="terms/">
  <section><div class="wrap prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p><h1 style="font-size:2.4rem;margin-bottom:24px">Terms of Use</h1>
    <Img k="whitepipe" eager />
    <h2>Using this site</h2>
    <p>This website gives general information about hydro jetting and related drain and sewer line services in Medina, Ohio. By using it you agree to these terms.</p>
    <h2>Information, not a guarantee</h2>
    <p>Content on this site is general. Every line is different, and the right approach depends on what a camera inspection shows. Submitting a request does not guarantee a service date or outcome.</p>
    <h2>Service requests</h2>
    <p>A request form or call is an inquiry, not a contract. Details of any job, including scope and scheduling, are confirmed with you directly before work begins.</p>
    <h2>Emergencies</h2>
    <p>For a sewage backup that is an immediate health or safety risk, keep people away from the affected area and contact a qualified professional right away.</p>
    <h2>Links and changes</h2>
    <p>We may change this site or these terms at any time. Continued use means you accept the current version.</p>
  </div></section>
</Base>
